  statStyles:'export styles', statAlign:'timeline aligned', statPrivacy:'subtitles uploaded', whyTag:'✦ WHY US',
  whyTitle:'Not “machine translation” — subtitle-grade translation', whySub:'Every capability is designed for “drop it into your video and it just works”', feat1T:'Precise timeline alignment', feat1D:'Translations follow the original cue timing one-to-one; merges and splits are distributed by duration — no drift, no shifting.',
  feat2T:'Consistent terminology', feat2D:'Proper nouns and ambiguous words are extracted into a glossary before translating, so cue 1 and cue 300 stay consistent; force-keep any term you like.', feat3T:'Smart line wrapping', feat3D:'Lines that exceed the width wrap at punctuation and word boundaries following Netflix language standards — never splitting a word in half.',
  feat4T:'Filler removal · ASR fixes', feat4D:'“Um, uh, you know” are cleaned automatically, and transcription errors in the source are fixed along the way — clean enough to burn straight in.', feat5T:'Bilingual layouts galore', feat5D:'Dual-line, stacked or top/bottom split — switch freely, export TXT side-by-side scripts, all the fansub-grade tricks.',
  feat6T:'Private by default', feat6D:'Subtitles are processed in your browser and never touch third-party servers; API keys stay on your device.', expTag:'✦ EXPORT STYLES', aboutTitle:'About AI-SRTSub',
  aboutBody:'AI-SRTSub is an open-source AI subtitle translator. We believe a good subtitle tool should be free, clean and privacy-respecting — no ads, no sign-up, no touching your files. Self-host it, file requests, polish it together.', aboutRepo:'GitHub repository', aboutLicense:'AGPL-3.0 open source', wsBackHome:'Home',
