  detHcT:'Between Simplified and Traditional — the words change, nothing else does',
  detHcL:'Convert a whole subtitle file across nine directions: general Traditional, Taiwan vocabulary, Taiwan forms, Hong Kong, and back to Simplified. Timecodes, cue numbers and ASS style tags stay byte-identical.',
  detHc1:'One Simplified character can map to several Traditional ones — the right one is picked by phrase',
