  detSpT:'Cut one file into parts, or many into one',
  detSpL:'Cut a long subtitle into parts by duration or count, each starting from zero if you like; join scattered files into an episode in order, or interleave them by original timestamps. Renumbering is automatic; dialogue stays untouched.',
  detSp1:'Cuts only at cue boundaries — never mid-line',
  detSp2:'Joining keeps the rhythm inside each part; the gap is yours to set',
  detSp3:'Interleave mode sorts by original timeline and warns about overlaps',
  detSp4:'SRT and VTT both supported; download part by part',
