  detLrT:'Listen and tap — an LRC takes shape',
  detLrL:'Load the music, paste the lyrics, and stamp each line while it plays; export standard LRC or SRT. Existing LRC files can be imported for fine-tuning. Space to play/pause, Enter to stamp, Z to undo — hands stay on the keyboard.',
  detLr1:'MP3 / M4A / FLAC / WAV / OGG supported',
  detLr2:'Keyboard-driven timing',
