  tcQcN:'Subtitle QC',
  tcQcD:'Check timing and layout by that language\'s rules',
  detQcT:'Run a check before you hand it over',
  detQcL:'Upload a subtitle, tell it which language it is, and 17 rules go through it one by one: reversed timestamps, gaps in the numbering, overlapping cues, too fast or too slow, lines too long, breaks in the wrong place, wrong punctuation — plus the rules only that language has: Spanish inverted question marks, French non-breaking spaces, Greek and Arabic question marks. Every finding carries the measured value next to the threshold, and whatever can be fixed is fixed with a checkbox.',
  detQc1:'17 rules, each switchable, each showing the measured value',
  detQc2:'Thresholds follow the writing system: Chinese is not counted as 42 characters',
