    detFxT:'Mono or bilingual — either way, ready for the screen',
    detDlT:'See a video you want? Save it right there',
    detTrL:'Pick your target language and drop the file in: sentence merging, glossary consistency and line wrapping all happen in one pass. The translation stays locked to the original timing — not a single cue drifts.',
    detClL:'Scraped subtitles come with ads, watermarks and hearing-impaired tags. Thirteen rules you can switch on and off, every change listed line by line and undoable one at a time — the timing never moves.',
    detFxL:'Whether you start from a single track or an already-paired bilingual one, this is where it gets its final look: font, size, colour, outline, position and margins, tuned one by one. The preview is exactly what you export.',
    detDlL:'RiseKol video downloader: paste a link and save the video, audio and original subtitles to your machine. A desktop app for macOS and Windows.',
    detTr1:'Translate between 100 languages; merged sentences are re-timed by duration',
    detTr2:'Proper nouns are collected into a glossary, so the whole file stays consistent',
    detTr3:'Long lines wrap at punctuation and word edges — no words split in half',
    detTr4:'Export mono or bilingual: SRT / VTT / ASS / SBV / TXT',
